Hi Keith (et al.),

Here's how you can extract the parameter table of lavaan's default baseline model after you fit your target model, and then fit it to verify anything of interest.

library(lavaan)
example(cfa)
(nullPT <- lav_partable_independence(fit))
(nullFit <- update(fit, model = nullPT))
summary(nullFit)

